; Modular ERB: OMOGATARI/EZB/BADName.ERB
;battle activity decision names
; The major factor is your Total # of battles.
; Items A and B serve as evaluation factors.
; A) First half of the name (adjective)
; 　　Short average turns per battle
; 　　Long average turns per battle
; 　　Average damage during battles
; 　　Number of surrenders
;    Fewest Number of accidents
;    Most Number of accidents
; 　　Highest consecutive win streak
;    Day count (fallback)
; 　　(any one of these elements)
;
; B) Second half of the name (noun)
; 　　Highest average accuracy per battle
; 　　Lowest average accuracy per battle
; 　　Fewest average number of status changes
; 　　Most average number of status changes
; 　　Highest damage dealt in one turn during a battle
; 　　Highest amount of enemies defeated in one battle
; 　　Highest win rate
;    Stage (fallback)
; 　　(any one of these elements)
; Whichever element is listed higher in A or B will be prioritized for reflection in the name.

